@baseUrl = http://localhost:8095

### 发送 OTP 短信（critical 优先级）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-001",
  "type": "OTP",
  "channel": "SMS",
  "templateId": "otp-sms",
  "data": {
    "code": "834291",
    "minutes": 5
  },
  "idempotencyKey": "otp-user-001-001"
}

### 发送营销 Push
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-002",
  "type": "MARKETING",
  "channel": "PUSH",
  "templateId": "flash-sale-push",
  "data": {
    "productName": "AirPods Pro",
    "discount": 7
  }
}

### 用户已关闭邮件偏好（应返回 BLOCKED）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-marketing-off",
  "type": "MARKETING",
  "channel": "EMAIL",
  "templateId": "order-email",
  "data": {
    "orderId": "ORD-123",
    "amount": 99.9
  }
}

### 模拟 Provider 可重试错误
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-retry",
  "type": "OTP",
  "channel": "PUSH",
  "templateId": "flash-sale-push",
  "data": {
    "simulateError": "TRANSIENT"
  },
  "idempotencyKey": "retry-demo-001"
}

### 查询通知状态（将上一步返回的 notificationId 替换到路径）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}

### 批量营销活动（流式 Kafka，不写千万行 DB）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": ["user-101", "user-102", "user-103"],
  "type": "MARKETING",
  "channel": "PUSH",
  "templateId": "flash-sale-push",
  "data": {
    "productName": "闪购专场",
    "discount": 5
  },
  "campaignId": "flash-sale-2026-09-16"
}

### Prometheus 指标
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
